OL,3,GNEWSATrust secures cash for 'hidden
OL,4,Agem' nature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust has raised money to
OL,7,Fbuy a large grassland habitat and turn
OL,8,Fit into a nature reserve.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Wildlife Trust said public
OL,11,Fdonations worth #400,000 meant it was
OL,12,Fable to secure 215 acres (87 hectares)
OL,13,Fof land near Hawthorpe.
OL,15,FThe trust was previously awarded a #1m
OL,16,Fgrant from Biffa Award, as part of the
OL,17,FLandfill Communities Fund, towards the
OL,18,Fpurchase.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
